    option.TONEMAP.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This fits the internal HDR or whatever range of color the shader is doing, to look nice on your SDR monitor. it will control general color processing - the contrast, saturation, white point, black point, hue shift, path to white, ect - each one has a different look
    option.SATURATION.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This controls how "colorful" the image is. negative values take away colors - positive values make them more intense.
    option.CROSSTALK.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This is a modifier of saturation - it offsets the saturation of the BRIGHT parts of the image.
    option.WHITE_BALANCE.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This controls how warm or cool the image looks - it balances the blues and reds.
    
