    option.DOF_QUALITY.comment= §bⓘ What is this?§r This is the "un-focus" blur in the background and foreground when a camera focuses its lense on something, sometimes referred to as "bokeh". §a⚠ PERFORMANCE COST:§r low to high
    option.MANUAL_FOCUS.comment= §bⓘ What is this?§r control how the camera lense focuses. "Auto-Focus" will focus on what you look at. "brightness Slider" lets you manually focus using the brightness setting in video settings. "Manual Focus" only focuses on a fixed point some distance away from the camera in meters.
    option.DOF_ANAMORPHIC_RATIO.comment= §bⓘ What is this?§r This is a recreation of the Anamorphic lense distorion, where it will stretch the out of focus/bokeh. 
    option.DoF_Adaptation_Speed.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This controls how quickly auto focus adjusts to where you are looking.
    option.FAR_BLUR_ONLY.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r make it such that it cannot do an unfocus blur on objects near you, only objects far away.
    option.REMOVE_HAND_BLUR.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r remove all blurring on your hand.
    option.DOF_DISPERSION_MULT.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This adds a color offset for red and blue, for a cool effect.
    option.CINEMATIC_BORDER_COVERAGE_VERTICAL.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This is the black bars on the top and bottom of the screen you might have seen in a movie. §a⚠ PERFORMANCE COST:§r basically nothing
    option.CINEMATIC_BORDER_COVERAGE_HORIZONTAL.comment = §bⓘ What is this?§r This is the black bars on the left and right of the screen you might have seen in a movie. §a⚠ PERFORMANCE COST:§r basically nothing

